ta":{"title":"Public Sector Digital Services \\(PSDS\\)","description":"Use the ServiceNowPublic Sector Digital Services \\(PSDS\\) application to deliver government services to constituents, businesses, and agencies on a single platform. Built on a government data model, Public Sector Digital Services provides prebuilt playbooks, solutions, configurable portals, and an AI-powered workspace that government agents can use to manage the full lifecycle of service requests—from intake to resolution. You can deploy Public Sector Digital Services with the applications that match your agency's needs. The applications are configurable and extensible using low-code tools to build workflows that are specific to your processes. Whether you're setting up for the first time or expanding an existing implementation, the content in this documentation set guides you through exploring the solution, configuring your environment, and using the product day to day.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/government-industry/bun-public-sector-landing-page.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":2,"tags":["#government-industry","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/government-industry/bun-public-sector-landing-page.md"},
